2:// T-DG5-BE-B). Per (elementType, stableKey) of the kind's element types, the RESOLVED elements (catalogue overridden
3:// by each version's rows, config-resolver.ts) are compared: `added` (present in `to`, absent or removed in `from`),
4:// `removed` (the reverse), `changed` (field-level from/to of the resolved attributes, plus `ordinal`). The kind's
5:// provider adds the rows of its own tables (ADR-0041's added form fields). Titles and definitions are compared as
6:// content, never by hash (a seeded hash is opaque; ADR-0039 §1). Read-only.
